# 0.1.22 相对 0.1.21 的净变化；一条一行，格式「分类|语言|内容」
updated|zh|「补充可用IP」升级为冗余写入：每个主机名把检测出的全部可用 IP 都写进系统 Hosts（同主机名多行冗余），单 IP 被掐时浏览器自动落到备选行
updated|en|"Apply usable IPs" upgraded to redundant writes: every usable IP found for a hostname is written to the hosts file as separate lines, so browsers fall back to alternatives when one is blocked
updated|zh|自动补位同步升级：IP 失效后自动改写该项目区段的全部活 IP（不只最优单 IP）
updated|en|Auto-replacement now rewrites all live IPs for the affected project, not just the single best one
